  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Grate carrot. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a small bowl, combine yoghurt, the honey and a pinch of salt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6788915f58a66637527fa964-71975c86.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small microwave-safe bowl, place 1/2 the garlic and the butter. Melt butter in microwave in 10 second bursts.\n• Place tortillas on a lined oven tray.\n• Brush with garlic butter and season with salt and pepper.\n• Bake until lightly golden and crisp, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6788915f58a66637527fa964-efa3afcc.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion and carrot until softened, 4-5 mins. Add Persian spice blend, tomato paste and remaining garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in the stock powder, coconut milk, lentils and the water and cook until slightly thickened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add baby spinach and cook until wilted, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6788915f58a66637527fa964-22c80533.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide lentil dhal between bowls.\n• Top with honey yoghurt. Serve with flatbreads.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6788915f58a66637527fa964-67690acd.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
